<title>UK: Ex-dividends take 3.921 pts off FTSE 100 index.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends take 3.921 pts off FTSE 100 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks traded ex-dividend on Monday December 30, FTSE International said, taking 3.921 points off the FTSE 100 index.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>  * British Telecommunications Plc 7.90  9.88     3.654</p>
<p>  * Severn Trent Plc			  10.50 13.13     0.267</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
